==Polish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|pl|sla-pro|*mǫžьščina}}, from {{af|sla-pro|*mǫžьskъ|t1=manly|*-ina|t2=collective|nocat=1}}, equivalent to {{affix|pl|męski|-ina}}. Until the 17th century, it was used as a feminine collective noun.

